     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "We made a tessellation with a regular decagon (10 sides) and an irregular hexagon. We see that the regular decagon will not fill the plane by itself. The gap is filled, however, with an irregular hexagon. These two shapes together will fill the plane.<br>\n<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBaVVQIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--09693554ff30497b5d12051e4240d0f59c6ff439/CS_Figure_10_05_UN016.png\" alt=\"\">"
